codex
The backend notification boundary is now in place: terminal success/partial and failure runs create one idempotent durable record, then attempt toast/webhook delivery without changing the run result if a channel fails. I’m adding the editor-facing settings and notification center next, including a badge driven by the persisted unseen count.
